   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "轉發 台灣電腦網路危機處理暨協調中心 TWCERTCC-200-202503-00000010",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Veeam Backup 和 Replication是Veeam核心備份軟體，近日Veeam發布重大資安漏洞公告。此漏洞(CVE-2025-23120，CVSS：9.9)允許經網域驗證的使用者，可遠端執行程式碼。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "情資分享等級: WHITE(情資內容為可公開揭露之資訊)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[影響平台:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Veeam Backup 和 Replication 12.3.0.310 (含)之前所有12.x版",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "[建議措施:]",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "將Veeam Backup 和 Replication 更新至 12.3.1.1139 (含)以後版本",
   "links": []
  },
